      "order": 3,
      "depth": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "Details of Kshethram:\nMoolavar: Naanmadiya Perumal\nThayaar: Talaichanga Nachiyar\nVimanam: Chandra Vimanam\nPushkarani: Chandra Pushkarani\nTravel: This kshethram is located in Talaichchangaadu village, near Aakkur, close to Sirkazhi, between Chidambaram and Mayiladuthurai.\n\nAzhwar Pasuram: \nTirumangai Azhwar – 2 Pasurams\n",
